        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eshionoono shiaAkhani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa abaana baIsiraeli bakhola eliobukhayi mwikhuwa liebindu ebiaahulilwa okhumalilanwa; mbu Akhani waKarimi waZabudi waZera, owoluyia lwaYuda, yabukula khushindu eshiaahulwa; mana oburima bwOMWAMI nibwashila abaana baIsiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa yaruma abandu okhurula eYeriko okhutsia eAi, elirondokhana naBetsi-aweni, khulubeka Iwebukwe weBeteli, nababoolela mbu Tikulushe mutsie muluure eshialo. Nabo abandu tsana nibatsia nibaluura eAi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibakalukha ewa Yoswa yali, nibamusunjila mbu Abandu baleshe okhutikulukha bosi; habula abandu shinga ebikhumila bibili bitaru batikulushe batsie okhuupa Ai; abandu bosi baranyakhana okhutsiayo ta; okhuba nabandu abatuutu butswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho khu-bandu bosi, abatsiayo bali shinga ebikhumila bitaru; nibeelukha imbeli wabandu beAi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abandu beAi nibeera khubo abandu shinga amakhumi kataru nabasasaba; nibabalondachilila okhurula hambeli weshilibwa okhuula khuShebarimu, nibabarootsela khushikholomokho; emioyo chiabandu nichiyengukha nichikwa amatsi namatsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Yoswa narandula tsingubotsie niyeekhupa hasi mafumama imbeli welisanduku liOMWAMI, okhuula olwa bweela, ye nabakofu baIsiraeli, nibeepuuka olufu khumirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa nasunga mbu Woowe, OMWAMI Nyasaye! Wabeele orie niwaambusia oluyia luno khuYorodani, mana nokhuhaana mumukhono kwabaAmori, nokhusishia? Khwali nikhukhoyile okhwihootselesia khwamenya injelekha weYorodani! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E OMWAMI, nemboole endie, olwa Isiraeli yafutaariile abasuku! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba abaKanaani nabosi abamenyanga mushialo balahulilakhwo, nibakhubotokhana, nibaakamia eliira lieefwe khushialo; nawe olakhola orie eliiralio likhongo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI nasunjila Yoswa mbu Buukha. Wikhupile hasi mafumama orio mbushiina? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isiraeli yoonoonile. Toto, kata bakhayile indakano yanje eya ndabalaka. Toto, kata babukuule khushindu eshiaahulilwa okhumalilanwa; bashiibile, nibeefwayafwayia, nibashira mumiandu chiabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko akachila abaana baIsiraeli nibaranyala okhusinjila imbeli wabasuku babwe ta; bafutaarililanga abasuka babwe, okhuba bakwile abaahulilwa okhumalilanwa. Shindalabeetsanga nineenywe khandi, nimuba nimuramalilana eshindu eshio eshiaahulilwa obumalilanwi eshili hakari weenywe ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buukha, wahule abandu, nosunga ori Mwiyahulile akomukamba; okhuba OMWAMI Nyasaye waIsiraeli aboola mbu Shiliho eshindu eshiaahulilwa okhumalilanwa hakariwo, iwe Isiraeli; shiolanyala okhusinjila imbeli wabasuku beenywe ta, okhuula olwa mulaba nimuyiniye eshindu tsana eshiaahulilwa okhumalilanwa eshiliho hakari weenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho mutsuli mulasitibwa ahambi mumbia tsieenywe lulala lulala; mana oluyia olwa OMWAMI alabukula lulasita ahambi mubilibwa bialwo, shilala shilala;nashio eshilibwa eshia OMWAMI alabukula shilasita ahambi munzu tsiashio ndala ndala; ne inzu eya OMWAMI alabukula, abandu bayo balasita ahambi, mulala mulala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana oulatiilwa nali neshindu tsana eshiaahulilwa okhumalilanwa, asambwe nomulilo, ye nende biosi ebia ali ninabio; shichila akhayile indakano yOMWAMI, khandi shichila akholile eshifwabwi muIsiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Yoswa nahuuna mumabwibwi nasitia Isiraeli ahambi mumbia tsiabwe; oluyia lwaYuda nilubukulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasitia ebilibwa biaYuda ahambi, eshilibwa shiabaZera nishibukulwa; mana nasitia eshilibwa shiabaZera ahambi, mulala mulala, naye Zabudi nabukulwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mana nasitia inzu yiye ahambi, mulala mulala, naye Akhani waKarami waZabudi waZera, owoluyia lwaYuda, nabukulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa nasunjila Akhani ari Mwana wanje, oheelesie OMWAMI Nyasaye waIsiraeli oluyali, nomwitsoomia, niumboolela bulaano eshia okholile; oramblsa ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhani nakalusia Yoswa, naboola ari Toto mwene, emwonooneele OMWAMI Nyasaye waIsiraeli, ne kano niko aka ekholile; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu olwa enduutsi mubiyaayilwe ingubo indayi yaShinari, netsifeetsa etsichelwa tsishekeli ebikhumi bibili, nokuchina kweitsahaabu okuchelwa tsishekeli amakhumi karaano, ekhaliishe omukongo, nimbibukula; ne lola, bibisilwe mwiloba mwiheema lianje mukari ifeetsa niyili hasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Yoswa naruma abarume, nibeelukha okhutsia mwiheema; ne lola, biali nibibisilwe mwiheema, neifeetsa hasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibabibukula okhurula mwiheema, nibeetsa ninabio ewaYoswa, newabaana baIsiraeli bosi; nibabiruula imbeli w ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Yoswa, nabaIsiraeli bosi, nibabukula Akhani waZera, nende ifeetsa tsana, neingubo, nelichina tsana lieltsahaabu, nabaanabe abasiani nabaanabe abakhaana, netsing'ombetsie, netsisishilitsie, namakondike, neliheemalie, nabiosi ebia yali ninabio; nibabileera heebanda liaAkhori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa nasunga mbu Okhuleereele amanyasio mbushiina? Nawe wesi OMWAMI alakhunyasia inyanga yino. AbaIsiraeli bosi nibamulasa namachina; nibabasamba nomulilo, nibabalasa namachina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibamubunjikhakhwo lifuumi likhongo liamachina, eliliho okhuula olwa leelo; OMWAMI nashiukhana narula khubululu bwoburimabwe. Niko akachila habundu tsana nihakulikhwa eliira mbu Libanda liaAkhori, okhuula olwa leelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.26",
